/a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-31T20:02:25-07:00","id":535131,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"http://i1238.photobucket.com/albums/ff483/Jozako/Peliculas%20MLP%20FIM/starwars.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4wh4FnwiAg\" target=\"_blank\">Of course, the show itself already beat the fans there...</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-31T20:09:42-07:00","id":535141,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/3197-here-be-ponies?p=533987#post533987\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#141823\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;We're going to celebrate the 100th episode of My Little Pony by showing all your favorite characters who have been sitting un-importantly in the background all of a sudden doing things..&quot;</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#141823\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">In any other fandom, I'd be questioning this so much. It still sounds really backwards.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, it works for me. <br /> <br /> You just have to acknowledge that,if not for the Bronies, MLP would almost certainly have gone down the same road as Hasbro's other revivals, like Care Bears and Strawberry Shortcake (is Littlest Pet Shop still being made?), making two seasons or so before cancellation. Instead, by appealing outside of its demographic, it's reached 5 seasons and 2 movies, with more on the way! Given that, while some may denigrate it as &quot;pandering&quot;, I think it's only natural and right to acknowledge the fans that made it all last so long with a love letter to the fandom. <br /> <br /> Of course, some people will be displeased no matter what, esp if their fanon isn't canonized...But at least Dr. Hooves has a British accent, so that's a step inthe right direction AFAIC!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-31T21:27:32-07:00","id":53519